{"job_id":"F-f648d77fd091e8c13950","family_id":"F-f648d77fd091e8c13950","title":"대법원규칙의공포에관한규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005741-33791-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":13,"target_id":"b267cda1849a604081a188172263fe97499d00c412eeda64a0c517e36ad3ec06","source_hash":"37121bd6af4a380587def3179f1da48968563bc29388672761c279ef302ca8ec","text":"关于最高法院规则颁布的规则"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005741-33791-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":52,"target_id":"85ee285ca720f9b78d3f74e0bb077d2a8b6ae016c5d444c00563e8ee4d9a3aef","source_hash":"a34ff537b877d8ba63c35cfda9a06ae4e7e18ba02247db2f853c53434949f621","text":"第一条（目的）本规则的目的是规定最高法院规则颁布所必需的事项。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005741-33791-ko","scope":"BODY","start":52,"end":185,"target_id":"9d9c28e25c7c1e731dfe498d7f14cf3b0bc156754b126ba7def30eaffc44aefd","source_hash":"f3f19a80438049680b2611d1e53a13fb4b97e544c48d4c0566420154ac2ba8f6","text":"文章 2（全文）\n① 最高法院规则（以下简称“规则”）必须附有序言。\n② 第1款序言应说明已获得法官会议决议，首席大法官签署后，加盖首席大法官印章并注明日期。<1988年3月23日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005741-33791-ko","scope":"BODY","start":185,"end":216,"target_id":"24019faf458ea9296baf103978bde734166f17fa7dc4de63db31955d1edf8145","source_hash":"6a04169a522a23fa40b3f6497428ad9677ea5e98b309f807b6883e3bad58823b","text":"第三条（规则编号） 规则应当按顺序编号颁布。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005741-33791-ko","scope":"BODY","start":216,"end":317,"target_id":"a5ad812961e91bc9303de00a70a2d85161d98858bab7847a903ef1851704ae24","source_hash":"c52fdb45e42375e72a48f798fc82fd715cf3314e49019a98db170ea8d2c38d02","text":"第四条（公布程序）\n① 最高法院法官会议决议通过后，法院行政办公室主任应当在决议通过后15日内办理规则的颁布程序。<1988年3月23日修订>\n② 规则的颁布应当在官方公报上公布。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005741-33791-ko","scope":"BODY","start":317,"end":361,"target_id":"9183eef4b31d272bc0cbdbe14d2afd66864048408bc11af2e54049a3c4a646be","source_hash":"f85b2d16144a937aa3355bd2173c71233a80910a3bca2845afc2064043fa25ce","text":"第五条（公布日期） 规则的公布日期为刊载该规则的官方公报公布之日。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005741-33791-ko","scope":"BODY","start":361,"end":419,"target_id":"1c2db2f24fffbc21c99165c9b2169d220309d1fa053fab21b906bc21ac91dc7d","source_hash":"de6cc061bd3ddc382001186067b35140db770fe37c1f3d7ef39f1e011b061ee5","text":"第六条（生效日期）除另有规定外，本规则自公布之日起20日后生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005741-33791-ko","scope":"BODY","start":419,"end":470,"target_id":"1872d13ba5b2757ae1295b790e3ccc80d291eb120af05f65188c16938b88d4de","source_hash":"bdd3e604996497a77b9c78055d116092a2c8371e847d0c5254c94ca1bfe55a7b","text":"补充规定 <第789号，1981年11月21日>\n\n本规则自1981年12月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005741-33791-ko","scope":"BODY","start":470,"end":576,"target_id":"c8f9fa7aee84ca5581b15f70282006db7e3339163db46a524121c76e0c14e324","source_hash":"723a9a647806965e97ab75b512a3a1b2dbc6bcdc9c16beee1a9cf8790dcb2b2d","text":"补充规定（关于根据《法院组织法》修正案（1987年12月4日颁布的第3992号法令）修改有关设立登记处及其管辖区域的规则等的规则）<1988年3月23日第1004号>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。"}]}